    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nova Survivors is a sci-fi survivor game focused on fast-paced combat and deep meta-progression. You'll land on a hostile alien planet and face relentless waves of monsters. The only way to survive this hell is to fight, upgrade, and permanently strengthen yourself!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adrenaline-Pumping, Fast-Paced Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no walk in the park. From the very first second, you'll be swarmed by hordes of monsters. We've meticulously designed the enemy waves to give you a thrilling experience, from desperately struggling to survive to clearing the entire screen in an instant. Use your dash to dodge fatal attacks and find a sliver of hope in a hail of bullets. Every second will get your heart racing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Unique Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic <strong>Shotgun</strong> to the auto-targeting <strong>Sentry Gun</strong>, from the path-burning <strong>Flamewalker</strong> to the chain-clearing <strong>Tesla Arc</strong>, the game offers dozens of weapons and skills. Through in-game upgrades, you can create countless combat builds. Will you choose the orbiting <strong>Saw Blade</strong> or the sky-falling <strong>High-Explosive Grenade</strong>? Discover the amazing synergies between them and create your ultimate winning combination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accumulate, Grow Stronger, Fight Again!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end, but the beginning of becoming stronger. Use the resources collected in battle for permanent meta-upgrades. Enhance your <strong>Max HP</strong>, increase <strong>Movement Speed</strong>, reduce <strong>Dash Cooldown</strong>, and even boost your <strong>EXP Gain Rate</strong> and <strong>Loot Radius</strong>. Every upgrade will help you go further in your next challenge, constantly pushing your limits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nova Survivors is a sci-fi survivor game focused on fast-paced combat and deep meta-progression. You'll land on a hostile alien planet and face relentless waves of monsters. The only way to survive this hell is to fight, upgrade, and permanently strengthen yourself!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adrenaline-Pumping, Fast-Paced Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no walk in the park. From the very first second, you'll be swarmed by hordes of monsters. We've meticulously designed the enemy waves to give you a thrilling experience, from desperately struggling to survive to clearing the entire screen in an instant. Use your dash to dodge fatal attacks and find a sliver of hope in a hail of bullets. Every second will get your heart racing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Unique Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic <strong>Shotgun</strong> to the auto-targeting <strong>Sentry Gun</strong>, from the path-burning <strong>Flamewalker</strong> to the chain-clearing <strong>Tesla Arc</strong>, the game offers dozens of weapons and skills. Through in-game upgrades, you can create countless combat builds. Will you choose the orbiting <strong>Saw Blade</strong> or the sky-falling <strong>High-Explosive Grenade</strong>? Discover the amazing synergies between them and create your ultimate winning combination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accumulate, Grow Stronger, Fight Again!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end, but the beginning of becoming stronger. Use the resources collected in battle for permanent meta-upgrades. Enhance your <strong>Max HP</strong>, increase <strong>Movement Speed</strong>, reduce <strong>Dash Cooldown</strong>, and even boost your <strong>EXP Gain Rate</strong> and <strong>Loot Radius</strong>. Every upgrade will help you go further in your next challenge, constantly pushing your limits!</p>",
    "short_description": "A sci-fi survivor game focused on fast-paced combat and deep meta-progression. This is no walk in the park. You'll land on a hostile alien planet and face relentless waves of monsters. The only way to survive this hell is to fight, upgrade, and permanently strengthen yourself!",
